From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bpereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 20:33:03 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Let the embedder manage author sheet and node lifetimes

Evict replaced and removed style-node cache entries when their final
owner disappears. Share parsed contents while keeping a distinct Stylo
registration identity for each live style node. Cover identity and
surviving cascade when one duplicate is removed.

Detach replaced nodes so embedders can preserve live wrappers, then
report every recursively dropped node, including attached shadow trees,
when reclamation is safe.
---
 src/document.rs | 87 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 src/mutator.rs  | 17 ++++++++--
 2 files changed, 100 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

